<title>USA: Ogilvy &amp; Mather picks Lazarus as CEO.</title>
<headline>Ogilvy &amp; Mather picks Lazarus as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ogilvy &amp; Mather Worldwide, a subsidiary of WPP Group Plc, said Friday it has named Shelly Lazarus as its chief executive.</p>
<p>Lazarus succeeds Charlotte Beers, who will remain as company chair, the company said.</p>
<p>Lazarus was president of the company's North America operations before becoming president and chief operating officer in December 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
